  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Train young Colombian women for a career in STEM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In June 2023, unemployment for young women in Colombia between 18 and 25 reached 22.9% and YOU can help us reprogram this reality!    Makaia&apos;s Bootcamp offers women from vulnerable contexts hands-on technical and vocational training in code and programming to find employment in tech, and overcome the gender IT gap. Help us improve the economic prospects of 100 women by enhancing their chances of getting sustainable, high-paying jobs in the IT sector.</narrative>
  </description>
